Olanzapine (diical nganggo nami &lt;a href="%27%27zyprexa%27%27"&gt;zyprexa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%27%27zypadhera%27%27"&gt;zypadhera&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="%27%27lanzek%27%27"&gt;lanzek&lt;/a&gt; atanapi dinu kombinasi sareng &lt;a href="%27%27fluoxetin%27%27"&gt;fluoxetin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%27%27symbyax%27%27"&gt;symbyax&lt;/a&gt;) nyaéta salah sahiji &lt;a href="atypical%20antipsychotic"&gt;atypical antipsychotic&lt;/a&gt; kanggo kelas &lt;a href="thienobenzodiazepine"&gt;thienobenzodiazepine&lt;/a&gt;, dilereskeun ku &lt;a href="U.S%20Food%20and%20Drug%20Administration"&gt;U.S Food and Drug Administration&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="FDA"&gt;FDA&lt;/a&gt;) kanggo ngubaran anu ngagaduhan &lt;a href="schizophrenia"&gt;schizophrenia&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="bipolar%20disorder"&gt;bipolar disorder&lt;/a&gt;, Olanzapine nyaéta bentukna sami sareng &lt;a href="clozapine"&gt;clozapine&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="quetiapine"&gt;quetiapine&lt;/a&gt;, mung asup ka kelas &lt;a href="thienobenzodiazepine"&gt;thienobenzodiazepine&lt;/a&gt;. Formulasi Olanzapine diproduksi jeung dijual ku &lt;a href="Pharmaceutical%20Company%20Eli%20Lilly%20and%20Company"&gt;Pharmaceutical Company Eli Lilly and Company&lt;/a&gt;; obat ieu téh obat &lt;a href="Jenerik"&gt;Jenerik&lt;/a&gt;. Pangjualan &lt;a href="zyprexa"&gt;zyprexa&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt; payu $2,2B di &lt;a href="Amerika"&gt;Amerika&lt;/a&gt; sorangan jeung $4,7B kabéhanana.
