<li>&lt;a href="Fudhail%20bin%20Iyadl"&gt;Fudhail bin Iyadl&lt;/a&gt;, sarta sababaraha &lt;a href="ulama"&gt;ulama&lt;/a&gt; nu séjén.</<li>
