<li>&lt;a href="Abdul%20Aziz%20Ad-Darawardi"&gt;Abdul Aziz Ad-Darawardi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Athaf%20bin%20Khalid"&gt;Athaf bin Khalid&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ismail%20bin%20Ja%E2%80%99far"&gt;Ismail bin Ja’far&lt;/a&gt; dan &lt;a href="Ibrahim%20bin%20Sa%E2%80%99ad"&gt;Ibrahim bin Sa’ad&lt;/a&gt; sarta para &lt;a href="ulama"&gt;ulama&lt;/a&gt; anu aya dina tingkatanna.</<li>
